  "contentHtml": "<p>목적:</p><p>1. Chat GPT의 경험</p><p>2. 친구들과의 협업으로 주기율표 완성</p><p>&#160;</p><p>방법:</p><p>1. google class에&#160; 교사가 샘플을 제시하고 자신의 번호에 해당하는 슬라이드를 완성하게 함.</p><p>&#160; &#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f63cb9ffbe419ba00d8f4dbb3a946f8c4a40acd8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f63cb9ffbe419ba00d8f4dbb3a946f8c4a40acd8\" data-origin-width=\"1198\" data-origin-height=\"658\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c664b90323a05bd259fb489a397f6fb2c52ad5c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c664b90323a05bd259fb489a397f6fb2c52ad5c2\" data-origin-width=\"1748\" data-origin-height=\"691\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"> 2.&#160; 이미지를 찾고 설명글 작성: 주로 네이버를 이용하여 검색.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">&#160; &#160; &#160;어려운 글들을 캡쳐해서 붙여놓곤 하죠. 이때 chat GPT를 이용합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3334eb6dd37462e2ee9042389959d6f76499614d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3334eb6dd37462e2ee9042389959d6f76499614d\" data-origin-width=\"1018\" data-origin-height=\"684\"></div><p>다시 명령을 내려봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dafd222bb4c1d035afca409243b21e9d0e5d0565\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dafd222bb4c1d035afca409243b21e9d0e5d0565\" data-origin-width=\"949\" data-origin-height=\"467\"></div><p>Chat GPT가 만들어 준 글을 다듬어서&#160; 각 원소에 대한 설명들에 작성합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>교사는 이 작업이 끝난 뒤 프린트하여 전시해 보는 거죠.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec170a622a92538b43cf26f6da249c58bcb1ac61\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec170a622a92538b43cf26f6da249c58bcb1ac61\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"1848\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>chat GPT를 접하면서... 과연 우리는 무엇을 가르쳐야 하는 것인가.. 생각이 많아집니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>웃고 가 보시겠어요?</p><p>17번 염소에 goat가 떡! 하니.&#160; ^^</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
